:: StoryTitle
The Power of Shadow

:: StoryData
{
  "id": "ombre-del-passato",
  "author": "Specula Elementae",
  "startPassage": "prologo"
}

:: prologo [opening]
The sky grows dark and everything slows down. In the dark you can hear sounds that disappear during the day and notice things that were hidden before.

[[Step into the shadow->inizio-avventura]]

:: inizio-avventura
Darkness dims the lights and helps you focus. Look at the screen carefully and choose the right card without rushing.

:: evento-round-5 [mid-story]
A great shadowy cloak covers you and protects you from enemy attacks. Use this moment to rest and prepare your move.

```gameEffects
{
  "ignoreWeakness": true,
  "roundSpecific": 5
}
```

:: epilogo-vittoria [ending victory]
Your choice was precise. You used the dark to observe the enemy and found the right path to win.

:: epilogo-sconfitta [ending defeat]
This time the darkness slowed your steps. Take a deep breath, look carefully at the cards, and try again.
